  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  title: Basic enemy
  bodyText: 'The basic enemy has an instant-aggro spherical trigger around them,
    which upon trigger, will wake them up and they will relentlessly follow you.


    When
    within attack range, they will charge up briefly before launching their body
    at the player to deal damage. An attack scheduler manages attacks to ensure no
    two enemies attack at the same time, only one after the other!'
